    "subtitleEn": "Almond-shaped, deep aubergine-purple, cured in red wine vinegar and extra virgin olive oil",
    "subtitleDe": "Mandelform, tiefdunkles Violett, traditionell in Rotweinessig und nativem Olivenöl gereift",
